  "summary_text": "Company metrics\nARR: $312k\nMonthly signups: 420 (record)\nFeedback and metrics and doc\nFeedback on feedback from a few managers: they were pretty chill about it\nFeedback is kind of a mystery\nFeedback is in good shape\nMetrics is mostly fine\nNo clear owner for doc\nFeedback on doc from people on the other team: they were surprised\nPreference to revisit it next cycle rather than draw it on a whiteboard\nExpense policy and values refresh and volunteering day\nExpense policy is a little fragile\nNo clear owner for expense policy\nConcern with expense policy: that we're overthinking it\nValues refresh is a bit of a black box\nOpen question: what the plan is for volunteering day\nVolunteering day is a known issue\nPreference to loop in the other team rather than split it into two pieces\nFollow ups and action items and recognition program\nFollow ups is the obvious next thing\nFeedback on action items from a few customers: they were pretty chill about it\nAction items is overdue for a cleanup\nRecognition program is weirdly controversial\nConcern with recognition program: that it slips again\nRecognition program is kind of fragile honestly\nCommunication plan and team offsite and notes from last time\nCommunication plan is overdue for a cleanup\nCommunication plan: it was slower than i expected\nNo clear owner for team offsite\nFeedback on notes from last time from the new folks: they said it's been like that forever\nTradeoffs and scope\nNo clear owner for tradeoffs\nScope is still pretty rough",
  "summary_markdown": "### Company metrics\n- ARR: $312k\n- Monthly signups: 420 (record)\n\n### Feedback and metrics and doc\n- Feedback on feedback from a few managers: they were pretty chill about it\n  - Feedback is kind of a mystery\n  - Feedback is in good shape\n- Metrics is mostly fine\n- No clear owner for doc\n  - Feedback on doc from people on the other team: they were surprised\n- Preference to revisit it next cycle rather than draw it on a whiteboard\n\n### Expense policy and values refresh and volunteering day\n- Expense policy is a little fragile\n  - No clear owner for expense policy\n  - Concern with expense policy: that we're overthinking it\n- Values refresh is a bit of a black box\n- Open question: what the plan is for volunteering day\n  - Volunteering day is a known issue\n- Preference to loop in the other team rather than split it into two pieces\n\n### Follow ups and action items and recognition program\n- Follow ups is the obvious next thing\n- Feedback on action items from a few customers: they were pretty chill about it\n  - Action items is overdue for a cleanup\n- Recognition program is weirdly controversial\n  - Concern with recognition program: that it slips again\n  - Recognition program is kind of fragile honestly\n\n### Communication plan and team offsite and notes from last time\n- Communication plan is overdue for a cleanup\n  - Communication plan: it was slower than i expected\n- No clear owner for team offsite\n- Feedback on notes from last time from the new folks: they said it's been like that forever\n\n### Tradeoffs and scope\n- No clear owner for tradeoffs\n- Scope is still pretty rough",
  "private_notes_text": null,
  "private_notes_markdown": null,
