      "end_time": "2026-09-24T17:02:53.530000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "the scope took like eight screens last time, if that helps.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-24T17:03:04.096000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-24T17:03:07.762000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Wait, are we worried about the hackathon? Right, like and I feel like the metrics is mostly fine, if that makes sense.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-24T17:03:07.831000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-24T17:03:15.165000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Hana Sato"
      },
      "text": "Sure, yeah.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-24T17:03:16.649000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-24T17:03:17.316000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Hana Sato"
      },
      "text": "Right, and when I looked at the ownership question for this, half of it is outdated. Real quick, I keep coming back to the metrics. Which, we said we'd do a quick spike and then the benefits update happened. Nobody really owns the doc right now, for what it's worth. Yeah. the annoying thing about the edge cases is it's taking longer than expected. Anyway, it feels like the spreadsheet and the priority list are kind of the same problem",
      "start_time": "2026-09-24T17:03:17.400000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-24T17:03:44.067000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Marcus Chen"
      },
      "text": "For what it's worth,",
      "start_time": "2026-09-24T17:03:44.074000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-24T17:03:45.407000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Marcus Chen"
      },
      "text": "if the process slips again, this is going to feel it.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-24T17:03:45.432000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-24T17:03:49.099000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "From my side, the annoying thing about the next steps is it's fine in theory...",
      "start_time": "2026-09-24T17:03:58.466000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-24T17:04:03.466000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Alex Kim"
      },
      "text": "Exactly.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-24T17:04:01.454000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-24T17:04:02.054000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Can we get more data?",
      "start_time": "2026-09-24T17:04:03.489000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-24T17:04:05.155000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Olivia Grant"
      },
      "text": "For what it's worth, I wouldn't block on the edge cases, which is fine. Plus the short version is the snack budget is bigger than we scoped, more or less.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-24T17:04:05.619000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-24T17:04:15.619000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Sure.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-24T17:04:15.636000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-24T17:04:16.236000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Felix Moreau"
      },
      "text": "Yeah no, I talked to the new folks about the priority list and they had had some good ideas. like The way I see it, I'm fine about the communication plan, or whatever",
      "start_time": "2026-09-24T17:04:27.436000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-24T17:04:38.436000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Felix Moreau"
      },
      "text": "Right",
      "start_time": "2026-09-24T17:04:38.461000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-24T17:04:39.061000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Felix Moreau"
      },
      "text": "Is it just me or is the office freezing today?",
      "start_time": "2026-09-24T17:04:39.602000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-24T17:04:42.935000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Olivia Grant"
      },
      "text": "Yeah",
      "start_time": "2026-09-24T17:04:43.468000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-24T17:04:44.068000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Olivia Grant"
      },
      "text": "I spent 20 minutes on the new hires and the feedback was mixed...",
      "start_time": "2026-09-24T17:04:46.158000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-24T17:04:50.492000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Basically for this specifically, the expense policy is a little fragile, you know like what I mean.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-24T17:04:50.533000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-24T17:04:56.200000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Fair.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-24T17:04:56.207000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-24T17:04:56.807000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "And.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-24T17:04:56.890000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-24T17:04:57.490000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "So did like anyone look at the recognition program on Friday?",
      "start_time": "2026-09-24T17:04:57.563000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-24T17:05:01.229000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "And then the thing I'd push on",
      "start_time": "2026-09-24T17:05:01.315000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-24T17:05:03.648000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Olivia Grant"
      },
      "text": "Interesting.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-24T17:05:02.587000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-24T17:05:03.187000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "is the internal tools survey.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-24T17:05:04.763000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-24T17:05:06.430000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Olivia Grant"
      },
      "text": "Wait, do we know who's looking at the backlog?",
      "start_time": "2026-09-24T17:05:11.541000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-24T17:05:14.541000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "So I'm not convinced the values refresh is a bit of a black box, anyway",
      "start_time": "2026-09-24T17:05:14.613000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-24T17:05:19.613000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Olivia Grant"
      },
      "text": "So what's the plan for the volunteering day?",
      "start_time": "2026-09-24T17:05:28.322000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-24T17:05:30.988000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "And.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-24T17:05:31.055000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-24T17:05:31.655000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Honestly, it's like, the Q and A is the scary part and nobody wants to say it. I spent most of the afternoon on the follow ups and there's more going on than I thought",
      "start_time": "2026-09-24T17:05:32.065000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-24T17:05:43.732000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Okay.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-24T17:05:43.768000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-24T17:05:44.368000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Honestly, this is kind of the test case for the risks. Anyway, if we pair on it, than the customer stories gets a lot easier. Which, we lost 20 minutes on the travel travel policy a while back. I think the new hires is a nice to have and the timeline is pretty close, so maybe do a proper write-up. Did anyone look at the scope a a while back?",
      "start_time": "2026-09-24T17:05:50.645000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-24T17:06:13.978000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Marcus Chen"
      },
      "text": "Um, is the internal tools survey still fine in theory, or did that change? For this specifically, the travel policy is pretty close, honestly. And I wouldn't block on the follow ups, you know what I mean. And then I think the follow ups is the obvious next thing and the Slack thread is on the critical path, so maybe simplify it.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-24T17:06:14.038000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-24T17:06:34.704000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Out of curiosity",
      "start_time": "2026-09-24T17:06:34.769000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-24T17:06:35.769000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "is the backlog still still pretty rough",
      "start_time": "2026-09-24T17:06:36.550000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-24T17:06:38.883000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "I mean, or did that change?",
      "start_time": "2026-09-24T17:06:38.955000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-24T17:06:40.955000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Part of me wants to do a proper write-up, part of me thinks it's still pretty rough.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-24T17:06:49.250000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-24T17:06:54.916000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "But I talked to a few customers about the action items and they were pretty chill about it...",
      "start_time": "2026-09-24T17:06:55.130000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-24T17:07:01.130000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Actually, I don't know if the Q and A is really the issue",
      "start_time": "2026-09-24T17:07:01.156000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-24T17:07:05.489000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker"
      },
      "text": "Right, so it's like, the recognition program is weirdly controversial and nobody wants to say it.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-24T17:07:05.517000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-24T17:07:10.850000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Wait, should we just get more data? Okay, so I'm fine about the volunteering day, in my opinion. But I'd love to draw it on a whiteboard, but the feedback is kind of a mystery. And there's a world where we revisit it next cycle and the expense policy just goes away.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-24T17:07:10.927000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-24T17:07:28.260000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Olivia Grant"
      },
      "text": "Right.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-24T17:07:28.704000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-24T17:07:29.304000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Olivia Grant"
      },
      "text": "Numbers: we're at 312K ARR...",
      "start_time": "2026-09-24T17:07:29.392000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-24T17:07:31.058000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Mm, if we get more data, then the slides gets a lot easier.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-24T17:07:31.155000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-24T17:07:35.488000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Marcus Chen"
